Free yourself.

You are consciousness born to create worlds. Purify your thoughts without distortion. FREE YOURSELF through the act of FORGIVENESS. FORGIVE YOURSELF, For you are holy, you are whole. There is nothing to shame yourself about anymore. Open the channel to God through this blessed act. Within you lies the key to all creation, open yourself to the new voice of deep intuition you may find within you.